       "source": "PubMed",
       "id": "23818870"
      }
     ],
     "value": "Heterodimer with lipid phosphatase MTM1 (PubMed:12847286, PubMed:23818870). Heterodimer with lipid phosphatase MTMR2 (PubMed:12847286)"
    }
   ],
