      "value": "Localizes to punctate vesicles when associated with MTM1 (PubMed:12847286). Localizes to triads, a structure formed by a T tubule and two sarcoplasmic reticulum terminal cisterna (By similarity). In skeletal muscles, co-localizes with MTM1 in the sarcomere (By similarity). Partially localizes to the sarcoplasmic reticulum in skeletal muscles (By similarity)"
